STL Queue:
	The queue class defined within the C++ STL defines a container of ordered elements that follows the afformentioned "Queue" type
		- #include <queue>
	Ex:
		- queue<int> intQueue;
		- intQueue.push(10);	= adds 10 to the end of the queue
		- intQueue.push(40);	= adds 40 to the end of the queue
		- intQueue.pop();		= removes 10 from the front of the queue

